</a></li><li class=\"flex items-center p-1 text-md gap-x-2 text-white hover:text-slate-500\"><a class=\"flex items-center\" href=\"#how\">How it works</a></li><li class=\"flex items-center p-1 text-md gap-x-2 text-white hover:text-slate-500\"><a class=\"flex items-center\" href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a></li><li class=\"flex items-center p-1 text-md gap-x-2 text-white hover:text-slate-500\"><a class=\"flex items-center\" href=\"#faq\">FAQ</a></li></ul></div><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-[30px] sm:flex\"><a href=\"#features\" class=\"text-[14.5px] font-medium text-muted transition-colors hover:text-white\">Features</a><a href=\"#demo\" class=\"text-[14.5px] font-medium text-muted transition-colors hover:text-white\">Live Demo</a><a href=\"#how\" class=\"text-[14.5px] font-medium text-muted transition-colors hover:text-white\">How it works</a><a href=\"#pricing\" class=\"text-[14.5px] font-medium text-muted transition-colors hover:text-white\">Pricing</a><a href=\"#faq\" class=\"text-[14.5px] font-medium text-muted transition-colors hover:text-white\">FAQ</a></nav><div class=\"flex hidden md:flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"bg-black/10 border border-[var(--line)] px-5 py-2 font-semibold rounded-sm text-[14px]\" href=\"/signin\">Sign in</a><a class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--brand)] via-[var(--brand-2)] to-[var(--brand-2)] px-5 py-2 font-semibold rounded-sm text-black text-[14px] \" href=\"/signup\">Start free</a></div></div></div><main class=\"flex-1\"><div><section id=\"hero\" class=\"px-6 lg:px-80 bg-[var(--bg)]/95 pb-10 pt-[54px] sm:pb-[70px] sm:pt-[90px] border-b border-[var(--line)]\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-7 md:gap-10 lg:gap-40\"><div><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--brand)]/10 to-[var(--brand-2)]/10 mb-[26px] inline-flex items-center gap-[9px] rounded-full border border-[var(--line-2)] bg-gradSoft px-[15px] py-[7px] text-[13px] font-medium text-ink3\"><span class=\"h-[7px] w-[7px] rounded-full bg-green-500 shadow-[0_0_10px_var(--green)]\"></span>Autonomous co-founder agent · Now in beta</span><h1 class=\"max-w-[14ch] text-[length:clamp(38px,6vw,68px)] font-extrabold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-.03em]\">Your AI Co-Founder — from<!-- --> <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--brand)] to-[var(--brand-2)] bg-clip-text text-transparent \">idea to investor-ready.</span></h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[60ch] text-[length:clamp(16px,2vw,20px)] text-[var(--muted)]\">Solirna AI is an autonomous startup co-founder for solo founders and indie hackers. It remembers your context, conducts research, generates investor-grade documents, and pressure-tests your ideas — so you go from concept to fundable company at unprecedented speed.</p><div class=\"mt-9 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3.5\"><a class=\"flex w-fit items-center gap-2 text-black font-semibold bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--brand)] via-[var(--brand-2)] to-[var(--brand-2)] rounded-sm px-4 py-2\" href=\"#demo\">Try the live demo<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#features\" class=\"w-fit bg-[var(--panel)] border border-[var(--line)] px-4 py-2 rounded-sm\">Explore features</a></div><div class=\"mt-[46px] flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-[38px]\"><div><div class=\"text-[28px] font-extrabold tracking-[-.02em] bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--brand)] via-[var(--brand-2)] to-[var(--brand-2)] bg-clip-text text-transparent \">12×</div><div class=\"text-[13.5px] text-muted\">Faster to first pitch deck</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[28px] font-extrabold tracking-[-.02em] bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--brand)] via-[var(--brand-2)] to-[var(--brand-2)] bg-clip-text text-transparent \">∞</div><div class=\"text-[13.5px] text-muted\">Persistent startup memory</div></div><div><div class=\"text-[28px] font-extrabold tracking-[-.02em] bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--brand)] via-[var(--brand-2)] to-[var(--brand-2)] bg-clip-text text-transparent \">7</div><div class=\"text-[13.5px] text-muted\">Built-in agent modules</div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative top-0 lg:top-30 mt-15\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-[var(--line-2)] bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel),var(--bg-2))] shadow-[var(--shadow)]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--glass-02)] px-4 py-[13px]\"><i class=\"h-[11px] w-[11px] rounded-full bg-[var(--traffic-red)]\"></i><i class=\"h-[11px] w-[11px] rounded-full bg-[var(--traffic-yellow)]\"></i><i class=\"h-[11px] w-[11px] rounded-full bg-[var(--traffic-green)]\"></i><span class=\"ml-2.5 text-[12.5px] text-[var(--muted)]\">solirna.ai/workspace</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 p-[18px]\"><div class=\"ml-auto max-w-[88%] rounded-[14px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--brand)] via-[var(--brand-2)] to-[var(--brand-2)] px-3.5 py-3 text-[13.5px] font-medium leading-[1.5] text-black\">Validate my idea: an AI tool that turns Figma files into production React code.</div><div class=\"max-w-[88%] rounded-[14px] border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--glass-05)] px-3.5 py-3 text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] text-[var(--bubble)]\"><b class=\"text-[var(--white)]\">Strong concept.</b>Pulling from your saved context (B2B, dev tooling). Running JTBD + Blue Ocean now → market is crowded but margins favor speed. I&#x27;ll draft a PRD and a 12-slide deck. Want me to start?</div><div class=\"ml-auto max-w-[88%] rounded-[14px] bg-[var(--grad)] px-3.5 py-3 text-[13.5px] font-medium leading-[1.5] text-black bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--brand)] via-[var(--brand-2)] to-[var(--brand-2)]\">Yes — and remember we&#x27;re targeting Series-A SaaS teams.</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-3\"><i class=\"h-[7px] w-[7px] animate-bounce rounded-full bg-[var(--brand-2)] [animation-delay:0ms]\"></i><i class=\"h-[7px] w-[7px] animate-bounce rounded-full bg-[var(--brand-2)] [animation-delay:150ms]\"></i><i class=\"h-[7px] w-[7px] animate-bounce rounded-full bg-[var(--brand-2)] [animation-delay:300ms]\"></i></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute -right-[18px] -top-[22px] flex animate-[floaty_6s_ease-in-out_infinite] items-center gap-2.5 rounded-[14px] border border-[var(--line-2)] bg-[var(--panel-2)] px-3.5 py-3 text-[12.5px] shadow-[var(--shadow)] max-[640px]:right-0\"><span class=\"grid h-[30px] w-[30px] place-items-center rounded-[9px] bg-[var(--grad-soft)]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand-2)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"plus\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></span><div><b class=\"text-[var(--white)]\">PRD generated</b><br/><span class=\"text-[var(--muted)]\">in 14 seconds</span></div></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-[22px] md:-bottom-[-220px] lg:-bottom-[-280px] -left-5 flex animate-[floaty_7s_ease-in-out_.5s_infinite] items-center gap-2.5 rounded-[14px] border border-[var(--line-2)] bg-[var(--panel-2)] px-3.5 py-3 text-[12.5px] shadow-[var(--shadow)] max-[640px]:left-0\"><span class=\"grid h-[30px] w-[30px] place-items-center rounded-[9px] bg-[var(--grad-soft)]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-list\" aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"lines\"><path d=\"M3 5h.01\"></path><path d=\"M3 12h.01\"></path><path d=\"M3 19h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 5h13\"></path><path d=\"M8 12h13\"></path><path d=\"M8 19h13\"></path></svg></span><div><b class=\"text-[var(--white)]\">Memory updated</b><br/><span class=\"text-[var(--muted)]\">+3 new decisions saved</span></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"px-0 py-20 bg-[var(--bg)]\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6\"><div class=\"translate-y-6 opacity-0 transition duration-700 ease-out data-[revealed=true]:translate-y-0 data-[revealed=true]:opacity-100 \"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-[54px] max-w-[680px] text-center\"><div class=\"mb-3.5 text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-[var(--brand-2)]\">Capabilities</div><h2 class=\"text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,46px)] font-extrabold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-.03em]\">One agent. The whole founding team.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-[17px] text-[var(--muted)]\">Seven deeply-integrated modules that share a single, evolving understanding of your startup.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-[960px]:grid-cols-2 max-[640px]:grid-cols-1\"><div class=\"translate-y-6 opacity-0 transition duration-700 ease-out data-[revealed=true]:translate-y-0 data-[revealed=true]:opacity-100 \"><div class=\"group relative h-full overflow-hidden rounded-[var(--radius)] border border-[var(--line)] bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel),var(--bg-2))] p-[26px] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-[5px] hover:border-[var(--line-2)] hover:shadow-[var(--shadow)]\"><div class=\"mb-[18px] grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-[13px] border border-[var(--line-2)] bg-[var(--grad-soft)]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"search\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-[9px] text-[18.5px] font-semibold tracking-[-.01em]\">Deep Market Research</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] text-[var(--muted)]\">Autonomous agent maps competitive landscapes, sizes markets (TAM/SAM/SOM), and synthesizes trend reports across any industry.</p></div></div><div class=\"translate-y-6 opacity-0 transition duration-700 ease-out data-[revealed=true]:translate-y-0 data-[revealed=true]:opacity-100 \"><div class=\"group relative h-full overflow-hidden rounded-[var(--radius)] border border-[var(--line)] bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel),var(--bg-2))] p-[26px] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-[5px] hover:border-[var(--line-2)] hover:shadow-[var(--shadow)]\"><div class=\"mb-[18px] grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-[13px] border border-[var(--line-2)] bg-[var(--grad-soft)]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand-2)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"doc\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-[9px] text-[18.5px] font-semibold tracking-[-.01em]\">Document Generation Suite</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] text-[var(--muted)]\">One prompt produces full PRDs, business plans, financial models, and investor-grade pitch decks with design-ready layouts.</p></div></div><div class=\"translate-y-6 opacity-0 transition duration-700 ease-out data-[revealed=true]:translate-y-0 data-[revealed=true]:opacity-100 \"><div class=\"group relative h-full overflow-hidden rounded-[var(--radius)] border border-[var(--line)] bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel),var(--bg-2))] p-[26px] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-[5px] hover:border-[var(--line-2)] hover:shadow-[var(--shadow)]\"><div class=\"mb-[18px] grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-[13px] border border-[var(--line-2)] bg-[var(--grad-soft)]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand-3)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"shield\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-[9px] text-[18.5px] font-semibold tracking-[-.01em]\">Idea Validation Engine</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] text-[var(--muted)]\">Applies SWOT, Jobs-to-be-Done, and Blue Ocean frameworks automatically to validate and stress-test new concepts.</p></div></div><div class=\"translate-y-6 opacity-0 transition duration-700 ease-out data-[revealed=true]:translate-y-0 data-[revealed=true]:opacity-100 \"><div class=\"group relative h-full overflow-hidden rounded-[var(--radius)] border border-[var(--line)] bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel),var(--bg-2))] p-[26px] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-[5px] hover:border-[var(--line-2)] hover:shadow-[var(--shadow)]\"><span class=\"absolute right-[18px] top-[18px] rounded-full border border-[var(--cyan-border)] bg-[var(--cyan-soft)] px-[9px] py-[3px] text-[10.5px] font-bold text-[var(--brand-2)]\">Core</span><div class=\"mb-[18px] grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-[13px] border border-[var(--line-2)] bg-[var(--grad-soft)]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"brain\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-[9px] text-[18.5px] font-semibold tracking-[-.01em]\">Persistent Startup Memory</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] text-[var(--muted)]\">Long-term retention via vector embeddings — Solirna remembers your pivots, decisions, and constraints as your company evolves.</p></div></div><div class=\"translate-y-6 opacity-0 transition duration-700 ease-out data-[revealed=true]:translate-y-0 data-[revealed=true]:opacity-100 \"><div class=\"group relative h-full overflow-hidden rounded-[var(--radius)] b